<v Zoe Kushlefsky>I'm here in Los Angeles.
<v Zoe Kushlefsky>我在这里，在洛杉矶。

00:47:22.040 --> 00:47:34.170
<v Zoe Kushlefsky>I'm in Los Angeles, California. I am attempting to break the record for the fastest time to type the alphabet with the little fingers. Oh, and I'm here with my witnesses, Rebekah Kochan--
<v Zoe Kushlefsky>我在加利福尼亚州的洛杉矶。我正在尝试打破用小指打字母表的最快时间。哦，我和我的证人丽贝卡·科汉（Rebekah Kochan）在这里——

