<v Elna Baker>Zoe goes up to her computer, holds her hands in the air, cracks her knuckles, and wiggles her fingers, warms up her pinkies.
<v Elna Baker>佐伊走到电脑前，把手举在空中，扳了扳指关节，扭动手指，热身她的小指。

00:47:45.360 --> 00:47:46.030
<v Zoe Kushlefsky>OK.
<v Zoe Kushlefsky>好的。

