<v Zoe Kushlefsky>I got it.
<v Zoe Kushlefsky>我拿到了。

00:48:05.360 --> 00:48:21.060
<v Elna Baker>4.6 seconds. The record to beat was 5.12. After a few months, Guinness writes her back. She was now the Guinness World Records' time holder. Zoe calls up Eliza to tell her the good news. She let me sit in and record.
<v Elna Baker>4.6秒。纪录是5.12。几个月后，吉尼斯回信了。她现在是吉尼斯世界纪录的时间保持者。佐伊打电话给伊莱扎告诉她这个好消息。她让我加入并录音。

00:48:21.060 --> 00:48:31.000
<v Zoe Kushlefsky>So, yeah, I got the record. How do you feel about that?
<v Zoe Kushlefsky>所以，是的，我拿到了纪录。你对此感觉如何？

